{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:50 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:50 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:50 2026-10-26 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0758261b76d4811c12e3033c5205754e/2026-10/central_0.png\"/><p>港島半山羅便臣道發生盜竊案。周日（25日）下5時57分，警方接獲一名姓李（56歲）女子報案，指其位於羅便臣道的單位內，一批約值60萬元的首飾不翼而飛，懷疑遭人盜去。</p><p>警方接報到場，經初步調查後，將案件列作盜竊，交由中區警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。警方正追緝一名37歲女子，據悉為上址單位外傭。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.105430+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:50:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:07.699740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:07.699740+00:00","content_hash":"906fcd0d87bb92916e7b8b9ae28103523f4ed9244f4e14c0c3447c670f0cf6b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}